From: Aeon <171243930+aeon1911@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:52:09 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/46] Import the Nintendo Switch port at uz5.0.3-nx3.7.

This is the Atmosphere port (SD cache, async assets, prefetch, shader
variants, loading screen, 30 FPS lock, core pinning, logs, glthread off)
applied onto UZDoom 5.0.3. Project Brutality behavior is still present
and comes out in the next change.
